WEBVTT

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.630
You're not gonna lose me
that easy.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:09.750
How did you...?

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.470
Uh, you might wanna keep
your eyes on the road.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.750
(GASPS) Kid!

00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:13.990
-(TIRES SCREECHING)
-(SHRIEKS)

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.630
(BRAKES SCREECHING)

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:16.790
(VANELLOPE GASPS)

00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.430
Yo, Department of Noise,
get out of my car!

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.030
Oh, man, what are we gonna do?

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:27.030
You just stay put,
don't panic.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.110
I'm gonna talk to her.

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:29.470
Ralph, be careful.

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:32.430
It's fine.
This is what heroes do.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:35.110
(GRUNTING, NERVOUS CHUCKLE)

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.270
My bottom is stuck.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:39.510
(YELPS, GRUNTS)

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.430
This car is not designed
for a big boy.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.230
I'll tell you that. Hi.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:46.950
You guys really thought
you could just steal my car?

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.270
Well, let me tell you
what's gonna happen now.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:52.070
No, wait, listen. We aren't
normally car thieves.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.350
My friend here,
she's a candy kart racer.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:56.670
You should see her
racing around

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.190
her sweet little track...

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.710
in her cookie wafer car
we built together.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.190
(GROANS IN EMBARRASSMENT)

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:05.710
And, well, the thing is, her
perfect little game broke...

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.550
and it was my fault...

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.870
so we're here
to try to fix it...

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:11.110
and we need money to do that,

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.870
and someone was
gonna pay us money...

00:01:12.950 --> 00:01:14.390
-to steal your car...
-Okay, okay.

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.430
-...and so we took it.
-You can stop crying.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.670
-(SNIFFLING)
-Though I do respect

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.590
your wonderful display
of vulnerability.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:21.390
(SNIFFLES) Thank you.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:23.110
I get it, I do.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:25.430
Friendship is
everything to us, too.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:27.990
-Right, guys?
-Word. We're like family.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:29.670
That's really great.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:31.590
So, does this mean
we can keep your car?

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.830
Absolutely not.
But I do want to help.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:36.070
Hey, you got
your phone on you?

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.190
-You know it.
-Let's make a video.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:40.470
Pyro, hit big boy
with the blow and go.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:41.590
I'd love to.

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:42.870
Wait. What's the...?

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:43.950
(AIR WHOOSHING)

00:01:44.030 --> 00:01:45.430
(SHOUTING) What are you doing?

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:47.950
Say something, first thing
that comes to your mind.

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:50.670
I'm gonna wreck it!

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.510
Good. All right.
Turn it off.

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.790
(SHOUTS) Ow.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:57.230
VANELLOPE: What the heck
did you do that for?

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.310
Yeah.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:01.270
There are much better ways
to make money on the Internet

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.870
than stealing cars...

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:06.070
such as becoming
a BuzzzTube star.

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:07.910
Am I supposed to know
what that is?

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:10.110
Oh, come on.
Everybody knows BuzzzTube.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:12.070
It's the video-sharing site.

00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:13.630
I'm just starting
your account...

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.110
-(CELL PHONE CHIMES)
-All right, there you go.

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:19.870
If this thing goes viral,
you can make a lot of money.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.950
A friend of mine,
chick named Yesss...

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:23.870
she's the head algorithm
over there.

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:25.230
Tell her I sent you.

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:26.510
Yesss will hook you up.

00:02:26.670 --> 00:02:28.910
Wow,
that's really nice of you.

00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:30.870
I'm not sure
if "nice" is the right word.

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:32.310
Well, thank you.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.230
I should be thanking you,
little sister.

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:35.790
That race was fun.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:37.430
Oh. (CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.510
Well, thank you again.

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:40.310
Uh... You know...

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:43.030
While we're talking shop,
what move did you do

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:44.630
to get through
that tunnel of fire?

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.550
Was it a power drift into
a drift jump, maybe, or...?

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:48.870
Maybe.

00:02:49.070 --> 00:02:51.190
If you ever wanna come back
for a rematch...

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.190
I'd be happy
to kick your butt again.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.550
-(CHUCKLES)
-See you.

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:55.830
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:02:57.270 --> 00:02:59.590
-(TRAIN HORN BLARES)
-(CROSSING SIGNAL DINGING)

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:09.910
Whoa.

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:11.190
Show-off.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:14.790
Man, oh, man,
that place was scary.

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.750
I know. It was so exciting!

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:18.830
No, exciting is
when you smile.

00:03:18.990 --> 00:03:20.470
Scary is when
you clench your butt,

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:22.230
and my butt is still clenched.

00:03:22.390 --> 00:03:24.270
Oh, come on,
are you honestly telling me...

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.390
that Shank lady wasn't the
coolest person you ever met?

00:03:27.550 --> 00:03:29.910
Cool?
Name one cool thing about her.

00:03:30.070 --> 00:03:32.190
Um, let's see, she looks cool,
she talks cool...

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.550
she drives cool, her hair
is cool, her car is cool...

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.710
Wait a minute, are you saying
my hair isn't cool?

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:40.990
What? No! I'm just saying
the game was next-level.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.590
There was no one telling you
what to do or where to go.

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.870
Hey, just where do you think
you're going?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:47.830
To BuzzzTube. It's this way.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.270
No, no, no.
We're going back to Spamley's.

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:52.270
He can give us
some easier loot to find.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:55.110
No, we're supposed to
see Shank's friend.

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:57.510
Oh, come on. I don't trust
that Shank one bit.

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.870
-Well, I do.
-Well, I... (GASPS)

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.630
-Hello, mister.
-Who are you?

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.790
I'm your friendly
ebay alert messenger.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.750
Huh. An actual eboy.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.350
Just here to let you know your
bid expires in eight hours.

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:12.430
Eight hours.
Okay, thanks, eboy.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:14.270
You got it, Jackson!

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:18.190
Chumbo, if we nickel-and-dime
it with Spamley...

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:21.430
it will take 20 years to make
enough money to buy the wheel.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.670
(SIGHS) All right, fine.
We'll do it your way.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:26.790
But I'm telling you right now,
that BuzzzTube place

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:28.350
is a terrible idea.

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:33.830
(OVERLAPPING NOISES ON VIDEOS)

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:38.630
Man, there are all kinds of
videos in here.

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:41.310
Yeah, if you like babies
and cats.

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.190
-Look, there's you!
-Oh, yeah.

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:44.750
RALPH: (ON VIDEO)
I'm gonna wreck it!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.230
(ALL LAUGHING)

00:04:47.590 --> 00:04:48.910
VANELLOPE: I wonder
why those little guys

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.590
are giving your video
all those hearts?

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.150
Because obviously
they love me.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.270
I told you this place
was a good idea.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:55.950
(SCOFFS)
Yeah, sure you did, doof.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:58.510
Now, who we supposed to see
about getting paid again?

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:02.030
The head algorithm.
Her name is Yesss.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.230
No. No. No.

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.230
Uninspired, clichéd...

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:09.230
Ugh! YouTube's got this one.

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.750
Chewbacca Dad? Really?

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.110
Yeah, it's like Chewbacca Mom,
but it's a daddy.

00:05:15.350 --> 00:05:16.510
-No!
-(DOOR OPENS)

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:19.630
Heyo!
Are you the head of Al Gore?

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:23.510
I am the head algorithm
of BuzzzTube...

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.430
which means
I curate the content...

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.070
at the Internet's most popular
video-sharing site.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.070
Which means,
I don't have time to trifle...

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:32.550
with every shoeless,
mouth-breathing hobo

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:33.990
that trundles into my office.

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.350
Call security, Maybe.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.070
Yes. (STAMMERS) But, Yesss,
this is the leaf blower guy.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.230
Who?

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:41.870
The man
with the undulating jowls.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.070
So?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.510
(WHISPERS) His video has
1.3 million hearts.

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:47.230
(EXCLAIMS) Well!

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.830
(LAUGHS)
Why didn't you tell me

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:51.710
I was in the presence
of a genius?

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.310
(SNAPS FINGERS)
Grab him a drink. (CHUCKLES)

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.750
Yeah, this lady named Shank...

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:56.230
she actually made the video.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.430
She's the one who told us
to come see you.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.630
No wonder
your video's so dope.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:02.590
Shank is for real cool.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.750
Right?

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:05.190
(SCOFFS) She is not.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:07.110
I'm the cool one
getting all the hearts.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.950
Well, that's right,
you big baby.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.030
-(YESSS COOING)
-(GIGGLES)

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.150
Yeah.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:13.310
Um, what'd you say
your name was?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:14.750
Ralph, Wreck-It Ralph.

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:18.030
Well, Wreck-It Ralph,
you are trending!

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.030
And these are for you. Hearts,
hearts, hearts, hearts.

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.950
-Hearts, hearts, hearts!
-Hearts, hearts, hearts!

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.070
Yes! Hearts!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.910
(BOTH REPEATING)

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:28.030
(BOTH LAUGHING)

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:30.070
Uh, not to buzzkill
the lovefest

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:31.510
you guys got going on here...

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.390
but Shank kinda told us that

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:36.590
viral videos can make,
like, actual money?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.670
Oh, hearts are money, honey.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:41.030
Your Buzzzy account
converts hearts into dollars.

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.190
Ka-ching!

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.030
RALPH: $43,000!

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:47.190
Kid, we only needed $27,001.
We're done.

00:06:47.390 --> 00:06:50.270
Oh, no, no, no. (LAUGHING)

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:52.150
That's $43.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.870
43? That's not even
half of 27,001.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:59.350
And we only have eight hours
left to save my game.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:02.390
Ugh. Well, I hate to say it,
but that ain't happening.

00:07:02.550 --> 00:07:04.110
Your video is tapped out.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.830
But I thought I was trenching?

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:06.910
Trending.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.230
You were.
But that was 15 seconds ago.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:11.110
Now, you're not. (CHUCKLES)

00:07:11.190 --> 00:07:12.190
Thanks for stopping by,
though.

00:07:13.670 --> 00:07:14.830
Aw!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:16.310
What are we gonna do, kid?

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.230
All right, pal, I have
an idea. And hear me out.

00:07:19.430 --> 00:07:22.590
What if we go back
to Slaughter Race

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:23.870
and I ask Shank really...

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.830
No, no, no. We're not going
back to that death trap.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:30.270
Yesss, what if I made you
a whole bunch of videos...

00:07:30.430 --> 00:07:32.710
of me doing all kinds of them
crazy things?

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.550
You mean saturate the market?

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.830
That could get you
a lot of hearts fast.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.270
Have you thought
this through at all?

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.870
What do you plan on even doing
in these videos?

00:07:41.070 --> 00:07:43.190
I'll just copy
whatever's popular.

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:45.870
Genius. Yo, Maybe,
what's trending right now?

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:47.990
Mmm-hmm.
Let's have a lookie-lookie.

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:50.270
As usual, human suffering
is number one...

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:51.870
followed by hot pepper

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:53.110
-eating challenges...
-(SCREAMING)

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:54.830
-video game walkthroughs...
-(GOAT SCREAMING))

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.150
oh, screaming goats
are back...

00:07:56.310 --> 00:07:59.430
unboxings, cooking demos,
makeup tutorials...

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:02.310
and lastly, ugh, bee puns.

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:05.150
(BUZZING) Let's "bee" friends.

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:07.030
(BOTH GROAN)

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:08.430
Two weeks in a row, guys.

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:10.150
That's a fortnight
of bee puns.

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:12.950
He won't be doing any bee
puns. They're beneath you.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.750
Oh, I'm doing a bee pun.
Oh, yes, I am.

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.710
And I'm eating a hot pepper,
and I'm putting on makeup...

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:20.150
and whatever else it takes!

00:08:20.310 --> 00:08:22.950
Because, kid, we came here
to save your game

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:24.310
and we're gonna do it.

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:26.030
I love it! Ha!

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:27.830
That is what the Internet
was made for!

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.830
Now, let's get to work.

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:32.110
(LEE YAWNING)

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.470
Seen it.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:35.310
Saw that one.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.750
Seen it. Seen it.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.910
-Huh?
-(MOUSE CLICKS)

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.070
(RALPH SHOUTING)

00:08:46.310 --> 00:08:47.710
(CHUCKLES)

00:08:47.790 --> 00:08:49.910
Yo, McNeely,
you remember Wreck-It Ralph?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.790
That bad guy
from the old video game?

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.630
Yeah, exactly.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:54.990
I'm gonna send you
a super random video.

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.070
Check it out, dude.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.870
Yeah, I'll give it a heart.
Whatever.

00:08:58.590 --> 00:09:01.790
(RALPH SHOUTING ON VIDEO)

